{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"discount-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.5","detected_language":"no","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"discount-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.5","keys":["discount-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.5"],"locale":"nb-NO","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Beregninger forblir nøyaktige brøker til de vises. Beløp avrundes til to desimaler, med halv cent-bånd unna null. Nøyaktige endelige verdier vises også. Avgifter, frakt, regler for minimumsbruk og butikkspesifikke kupongbegrensninger utledes ikke.","record_id":"f1ebf77213f7e2156650e1343f45978317b61117439a90a19be02e37835a1876","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":1.5306709724999905,"source":"Calculations remain exact fractions until display. Amounts round to two decimal places, with half-cent ties away from zero. Exact final values are also shown. Tax, shipping, minimum-spend rules and store-specific coupon restrictions are not inferred.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"23d3f820fe224c0931a2e4649ac10e8b2399f6f530315d67eb55ed0915ee2ca6","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Beregninger forblir nøyaktige brøker til de vises. Beløp avrundes til to desimaler, med halv cent-bånd unna null. Nøyaktige endelige verdier vises også. Avgifter, frakt, regler for minimumsbruk og butikkspesifikke kupongbegrensninger utledes ikke.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
